<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Birmingham Steel raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Birmingham Steel raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it upgraded Birmingham Steel Corp to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The stock was unchanged at 15-5/8.</p>
</text>
